# 🛰️ Satellite Position Predictor — ML System

I have developed an ML-powered satellite position prediction system using Python, Streamlit, SGP4, Skyfield, Scikit-learn, and XGBoost.

## 🚀 Features

- Live satellite TLE data fetching from CelesTrak
- Satellite position calculation using SGP4 and Skyfield
- Interactive world map visualization
- Satellite ground-track visualization
- Machine Learning based future position prediction
- Random Forest and XGBoost models
- Model accuracy evaluation using MAE, RMSE, and R²
- Satellite information and TLE details
- Future latitude, longitude, altitude, and speed prediction

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- XGBoost
- SGP4
- Skyfield
- Plotly
- Joblib
- CelesTrak API

